          "exampleId": "w:control#e-55f8cff67efd9ab3",
          "text": "Participants were randomly divided into two groups: the “beauty” group was asked to actively consider and then rate the beauty of each object they viewed, while the control group just matched a line drawing of the object with the artwork itself.",
          "source": {
